  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The in-game blocking system is very confusing. It's surprisingly easy to block someone by just trying to turn up someone's volume (something our friend has done before) and there's no way to unblock via in game. you have to go in via the website, find them there, and unblock them. you then have to restart your entire client just to see them. this is painfully tedious, especially if you're in VR.\ni would suggest moving the block button to somewhere it wouldn't be so easy to hit and/or have a warning message. something similar to \"are you sure you want to block _______?\" and also add an in-game way to unblock people. maybe implement an unblock button on their profile? or have a list on the social tab for blocked players?",
